'''Pheromosa''' (Japanese: '''フェローチェ''' ''Pheroache'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

