==Trivia==
===Origin===
*The '''Jump Blues''' attack is named after {{wp|jump blues}}, a genre of music. The name may have been chosen in reference to {{p|Pheromosa}}'s athletic prowess.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

